1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,034
Seniors often leave their phones charging in another room, but a smartwatch stays right on their wrist.

2
00:00:07,034 --> 00:00:10,126
PNCC Care includes a standalone Apple Watch app.

3
00:00:10,126 --> 00:00:18,049
When parents wake up in the morning, they simply glance at their wrist and tap the green checkmark to confirm they're safe.

4
00:00:18,049 --> 00:00:23,009
If a check-in is pending, the watch delivers gentle haptic taps on the wrist.

5
00:00:23,009 --> 00:00:32,672
In case of an emergency, pressing the red SOS button on the watch face calls for help immediately, providing continuous protection wherever they walk.
